  "notes": [
    "तीखा means hot and spicy (chilli). मसालेदार means full of spices, not always hot.",
    "In a restaurant, people often call the waiter भैया. Dishes are usually shared from the middle of the table.",
    "मेरी तरफ़ से (\"from my side\") means \"my treat\". Friends often argue happily over who pays.",
